# Figma personal access token — SERVER-SIDE ONLY. Generate at:
# https://www.figma.com/developers/api#access-tokens
#
# The web app's /api/import route (and asset export via the Images API) uses
# this key on the server; it is never sent to the browser or logged. The
# hosted deployment uses the deployer's key — visitors cannot supply their
# own token. To import your own Figma files, run the app locally with this
# set in apps/web/.env.local, or use the CLI (`forgeui generate`) with
# FIGMA_API_KEY in your shell environment.
FIGMA_API_KEY=your_figma_personal_access_token_here
